rn for others, excellent attention, but note communication difficulty and egocentricness as concerns, but perhaps less severe than unfriendly and unhealthy.\n\nThus we can change vote to Candidate A.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate A\".\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: mention that I agree with the need to consider crew cooperation, bring up C's unfriendly and unhealthy habits, argue that A's reliability and concern for others make them a better fit, despite communication issues.\n\nProceed."}
